<title>USA: Huntington unit sets $100 mln bank notes.</title>
<headline>Huntington unit sets $100 mln bank notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Huntington Bancshares Inc's Huntington National Bank was priced on Tuesday, according to sole manager NationsBanc Capital Markets Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER HUNTINGTON NATIONAL BANK</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 6.15 PCT   MATURITY 01/21/1999</p>
<p>TYPE BANK NOTES    ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 07/01/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD  6.15 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 17 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>((U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
